    "claims": [
      "Groups customers into hierarchies such as buying associations by region or country",
      "Prices and discounts set at a hierarchy level apply to all customers beneath it",
      "Price is chosen by a ranked search order rather than the lowest price",
      "Multi-level line and invoice discounts on original or already discounted value",
      "Adds free-of-charge goods to sales orders marked as rebate in kind",
      "Automatically inserts surcharge and discount lines, including freight by delivery terms",
      "Calculates retroactive bonuses on sales or turnover, optionally staggered",
      "Calculates sales rep commission on sales or revenue",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
